 doc=['# R142 — Paired RGB teacher with intact full-reader adaptation','','## Decision','','**'+dec['disposition']+'**. R141 native-point expansion remains rejected. R142 follows its positive image-only ablation with a matched image-binding control; this is exposed-target method development, not independent confirmation. The frozen prerequisite and conditional source-reader/TTA design were registered before new controls/task scores. Original A256, A1024, all six query positions, three intact source-prepared model states and complete live competition remain fixed; no new expert, source-weight training or FINAL. All1798 inputs and1034 completeFrozenA noB fallbacks remain.','','## Why this is a different bounded comparison','','R141 joint nativeB+RGBB failed against oldFrozenF and extraA. Its Fpoints+actualRGBB image-only ablation scored13.670700% versusFrozenF13.580861% in design-weighted six-direction mean, but lacked an exact image-only wrongbinding control. Old R105 imagebanks also failed on its earlier protocol; it is retained as contrary evidence, not described as untested. Here every source Adapter/gate/matching/interface path is intact, raw Fpoint input remains the original validA/B average, and actualB images are encoded separately by the same small source CNN. RGBB-only means an additionalB image bank alongsideA; it does not mean an RGB-only grounding network.','','Phase1 reuses exactR141 FrozenA/F,R135A/F,R136correct/direct and correct F_RGBB_only predictions. New frozen arms are the matching F_RGBB_only_wrong, F_Bimage_only_teacher and F_Bimage_only_wrong_teacher. Only visibleB point-to-pixel bindings permute, with the inverse reverse graph updated; pointfeatures/imagepixels/visibility/sequence budget stay fixed. DuplicateA imagebank equivalence is independently engineering-checked againstFrozenF. Both source and original A geometry/role priors retain cameraA coordinates; no B query numbers or objectIDs are copied between different text forwards.','','## Frozen prerequisite results','',table(fmt(rd(H/'IMAGE_AGGREGATE_ROWS.json')),['aggregation','arm','mIoU','Acc25','Acc50']),'',json.dumps(imdec,indent=2),'','The registered frozen gate requires correctF_RGBB_only to beatFrozenF and matchedwrong in both raw and design-weighted six-direction means. No requirement that every direction rise is added. The pure Bimage teacher is also reported, not assumed correct. Geometry-consistent graph construction does not independently certify target-instance identity.','','## Conditional parameter experiment','','Executed: **'+str(done)+'**. Phase2 is permitted only after the frozen prerequisite passes; if it fails, sourcecalibration and allTTA are skipped, even though conditional implementation files are available. No target-selected imagefusion weight, confidence threshold or new loss is introduced.']
